---
import BaseHead from '../../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import FooterScripts from '../../../../components/FooterScripts.astro';
import SrkrHeader from '../../../../components/SrkrHeader.astro';
import SrkrFooter from '../../../../components/SrkrFooter.astro';
import OffCanvas from '../../../../components/OffCanvas.astro';
import DeptNav from '../../../../components/DeptNav.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="English & Foreign Languages | Applied Sciences | SRKR" description="Department of English and Foreign Languages at SRKR Engineering College. Academic programs, labs, TOEFL/GRE test center, and global opportunities." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/banner/ash.jpg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments/ash/">Applied Sciences</a></li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">English & Foreign Languages</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-5">
      <div class="container">
        <DeptNav dept="ash" current="English & Foreign Languages" />

        <div class="row mb-5 pb-4">
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-4">Department of English and Foreign Languages</h3>
              
              <div class="quote-box p-4 mb-4 border-start border-4" style="border-color: var(--rt-primary) !important; background-color: #f8fafc; font-style: italic; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6;">
                "Vaagarthaaviva Sampruktou Vaagartha Pratipattaye..."—the timeless words from ancient Indian wisdom remind us that speech and meaning are inseparable, just as Goddess Parvati and Lord Parameswara are united in harmony. Inspired by this philosophy, the Department of English and Foreign Languages believes that language is not merely a tool of communication but a bridge to knowledge, confidence, and success.
              </div>

              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.7;">With a team of dedicated and accomplished faculty, the department nurtures students to become confident communicators, critical thinkers, and lifelong learners. Our mission is to help every student discover the power of words and develop the fluency, clarity, and confidence needed for both professional excellence and personal growth.</p>
              
              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.7;">Established with a vision to impart high-quality education in English and foreign languages, the department has earned a reputation for academic excellence and professional training. Beyond classroom instruction, we offer comprehensive programmes in personality development, communication skills, career readiness, and placement training. Specialized coaching for international proficiency examinations such as GRE, TOEFL, IELTS, and Duolingo English Test further prepares students to pursue higher education and global career opportunities.</p>
              
              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.7;">By blending rich pedagogical practices with innovative learning experiences, the department continues to inspire students to communicate with confidence, think with clarity, and lead with purpose.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- TOEFL/GRE Test Center Section -->
            <div class="test-center-details mt-5 p-4 border rounded" style="background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
              <h4 class="mb-4" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--rt-primary);">
                <i class="fa-light fa-circle-location-arrow"></i> Authorized TOEFL & GRE Test Center
              </h4>
              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">The institution has successfully formalized a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with Educational Testing Service (ETS), the globally recognized body that administers the GRE and TOEFL examinations. Following the MoU, the college has established a fully functional, authorized test centre on campus in compliance with ETS guidelines.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">The facility is equipped with secure, standardized infrastructure including dedicated testing labs, high-speed internet connectivity, surveillance systems, and uninterrupted power supply to ensure a seamless and secure testing environment.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">Trained personnel have been appointed and certified as per ETS requirements to manage test administration, uphold examination integrity, and ensure adherence to international testing protocols. The centre has already commenced operations and is capable of conducting GRE and TOEFL examinations for both institutional students and external candidates.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">The establishment of this centre significantly enhances the institution’s academic ecosystem by providing students with direct access to globally recognized assessments, supporting higher education aspirations abroad, and strengthening the institution’s international engagement and reputation. Moreover, the institution has also inked an MoU with Northeastern Universities for better opportunities for students.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Sidebar (HOD & Facilities) -->
          <div class="col-lg-4 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
            <div class="hod-card p-4 border rounded text-center mb-4" style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;">
              <h5 class="border-bottom pb-3 mb-3" style="color: var(--rt-primary);">Head of the Department</h5>
              <div class="staf-image mb-3 text-center d-flex justify-content-center">
                <img src="/assets/images/faculty/english/1050.jpg" alt="Dr. Satish Kumar Nadimpalli" style="width: 150px; height: 150px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;" />
              </div>
              <h5 class="mb-1">Dr. Satish Kumar Nadimpalli</h5>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-2" style="line-height: 1.4;">M.A.(Eng.), M.A.(Ling.), PGDTE, PGDELL, M.Phil., Ph.D.(EFLU), UGC-NET, AP & TS-SET.</p>
              <span class="badge px-3 py-2 mt-1" style="background-color: var(--rt-primary); color: white;">Associate Professor & Head I/c</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Facilities Card -->
            <div class="facilities-card p-4 border rounded" style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;">
              <h5 class="border-bottom pb-3 mb-3" style="color: var(--rt-primary);">Facilities</h5>
              <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="padding-left: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 10px;">
                  <i class="fa-light fa-circle-nodes" style="color: var(--rt-primary); margin-top: 5px;"></i>
                  <div>
                    <strong>Communication Skills Lab</strong>
                    <div class="text-muted small mt-1">Equipped with interactive audio-visual learning tools.</div>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 10px;">
                  <i class="fa-light fa-language" style="color: var(--rt-primary); margin-top: 5px;"></i>
                  <div>
                    <strong>Viswakavi Multilingual Communication Skills Lab</strong>
                    <div class="text-muted small mt-1">State-of-the-art multilingual training system.</div>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0; display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 10px;">
                  <i class="fa-light fa-building-columns" style="color: var(--rt-primary); margin-top: 5px;"></i>
                  <div>
                    <strong>TOEFL/GRE Test Center</strong>
                    <div class="text-muted small mt-1">ETS-authorized secure testing environment.</div>
                  </div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Activities, Clubs, Professional Bodies, Cells, Others -->
        <div class="row mt-5 pt-4">
          <!-- Activities Section -->
          <div class="col-12 mb-5">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-4" style="color: var(--rt-primary); border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 10px;">Activities & Focus Areas</h3>
            <div class="row g-3">
              {[
                { name: 'General English', icon: 'fa-language' },
                { name: 'CRT (Campus Recruitment Training)', icon: 'fa-user-tie' },
                { name: 'Soft Skills Training', icon: 'fa-handshake' },
                { name: 'Personality Development Training', icon: 'fa-user-gear' },
                { name: 'Counselling and Coaching for Higher Education', icon: 'fa-graduation-cap' },
                { name: 'Psychological Counselling', icon: 'fa-brain' },
                { name: 'Community Outreach Programs', icon: 'fa-users' }
              ].map(act => (
                <div class="col-md-6">
                  <div class="px-4 py-3 border rounded d-flex align-items-center gap-3 h-100" style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important; font-weight: 500;">
                    <i class={`fa-light ${act.icon}`} style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-size: 1.25rem;"></i>
                    <span>{act.name}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Clubs Section -->
          <div class="col-12 mb-5">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-4" style="color: var(--rt-primary); border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 10px;">Clubs</h3>
            
            <div class="card-item p-4 border rounded mb-4" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
              <h5 style="color: var(--rt-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;" class="mb-3">
                <i class="fa-light fa-comments-alt"></i> S.R.K.R. Toastmasters
              </h5>
              <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7;" class="mb-0">Chartered on March 8, 2019, SRKR Toastmasters Club brought Toastmasters International to campus to build professional oratory and leadership skills. Since then, the club has earned multiple "Golden Gavel" awards and reached a major milestone in 2023 when A. Jayasri of Computer Science Engineering won the Master Orator Championship at ISB Hyderabad. With consistent Distinguished Club status, the club continues to foster corporate-ready skills and remains a cornerstone of student success.</p>
              
              <div class="mt-4 text-center">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/toastmasters.jpg" alt="SRKR Toastmasters" style="max-width: 600px; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card-item p-4 border rounded" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
              <h5 style="color: var(--rt-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;" class="mb-3">
                <i class="fa-light fa-feather"></i> Language Nest (Language Club)
              </h5>
              <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7;" class="mb-0">Launched on January 8, 2022, the Language Nest is a student-led literary club uniquely governed by first and second-year engineers to foster early leadership and communication skills. Since its inception, it has developed a vibrant culture through signature events like the "Battle of Wits" and "Know Your Friend," providing a creative sanctuary for students to shed their inhibitions. Its primary achievement is the successful democratization of public speaking at the entry-level of the engineering profession.</p>
              
              <div class="row mt-4 g-3 justify-content-center align-items-center">
                <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                  <img src="/assets/images/program/languagenest-1.jpg" alt="Language Nest Activity 1" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                  <img src="/assets/images/program/languagenest-2.jpg" alt="Language Nest Activity 2" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);" />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Professional Bodies & Cells Section -->
          <div class="col-12 mb-5">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-4" style="color: var(--rt-primary); border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 10px;">Professional Bodies & Support Cells</h3>

            <div class="card-item p-4 border rounded mb-4" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
              <h5 style="color: var(--rt-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;" class="mb-3">
                <i class="fa-light fa-users-rectangle"></i> ELT@I Godavari Chapter
              </h5>
              <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7;" class="mb-0">The ELT@I Godavari Chapter, a regional chapter of the English Language Teachers' Association of India (ELT@I), was established by the Department of English and Foreign Languages, SRKR Engineering College, with the objective of promoting excellence in English Language Teaching (ELT) and fostering professional development among English language educators. The chapter has successfully organized webinars and academic programmes featuring distinguished ELT professionals. Faculty members of the department, Dr. Satish Kumar Nadimpalli and Prof. Bh. V. N. Lakshmi, have actively contributed to ELT@I as resource persons, moderators for academic sessions, and article reviewers for the ELT@I Annual Conferences, reflecting the department's sustained engagement with the national ELT community.</p>
              
              <div class="row mt-4 g-3 justify-content-center align-items-center">
                <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                  <img src="/assets/images/program/elti-1.jpg" alt="ELT@I Chapter Event 1" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                  <img src="/assets/images/program/elti2.jpg" alt="ELT@I Chapter Event 2" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);" />
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                  <img src="/assets/images/program/elti3.jpg" alt="ELT@I Chapter Event 3" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);" />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card-item p-4 border rounded" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
              <h5 style="color: var(--rt-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;" class="mb-3">
                <i class="fa-light fa-brain-circuit"></i> Psychological Counselling Cell (PCC)
              </h5>
              <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7;" class="mb-0">The Psychological Counselling Cell at SRKR Engineering College is dedicated to promoting the mental and emotional well-being of students. The cell provides a supportive and confidential environment where students can discuss academic, personal, emotional, and social concerns. It aims to help students cope with stress, anxiety, adjustment issues, and other psychological challenges that may affect their academic performance and personal growth. The cell organizes awareness programmes, counselling sessions, workshops, and interactive activities to enhance emotional resilience and positive mental health.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Others (Campus Chronicle) -->
          <div class="col-12 mb-5">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-4" style="color: var(--rt-primary); border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 10px;">Others</h3>
            <div class="card-item p-4 border rounded" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-color: #e2e8f0 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
              <h5 style="color: var(--rt-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;" class="mb-3">
                <i class="fa-light fa-newspaper"></i> Campus Chronicle (4-Monthly Campus Newsletter)
              </h5>
              
              <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 15px;">The ‘Campus Chronicle’ of SRKR Engineering College (Autonomous), Bhimavaram, serves as a vibrant record of the institution’s academic excellence, innovations, achievements, and student life. The Campus Chronicle highlights the dynamic activities taking place across the college throughout the academic year. It documents significant events such as technical symposiums, hackathons, workshops, seminars, research initiatives, industry collaborations, and cultural celebrations. The publication also showcases the accomplishments of students and faculty members in academics, innovation, entrepreneurship, sports, and extracurricular activities.</p>
                  <p style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px;">A key feature of the Chronicle is its focus on student success. It regularly reports outstanding placement achievements, internship opportunities, startup ventures, and national-level competition victories. Through these stories, the Chronicle reflects the institution’s emphasis on holistic development and career readiness. More than a newsletter, the Campus Chronicle is a reflection of SRKR’s journey towards academic distinction, innovation, and social responsibility.</p>
                  
                  <div class="chronicle-archive mt-4">
                    <h6 class="mb-3" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                      <i class="fa-light fa-books"></i> Archive Editions
                    </h6>
                    <div class="row g-3">
                      <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light" style="font-size: 14px; height: 100%;">
                          <strong>Volume 6</strong>
                          <div class="mt-2">
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle16.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-3"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 1</a>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light" style="font-size: 14px; height: 100%;">
                          <strong>Volume 5</strong>
                          <div class="mt-2">
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle13.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 1</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle14.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 2</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle15.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 3</a>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light" style="font-size: 14px; height: 100%;">
                          <strong>Volume 4</strong>
                          <div class="mt-2">
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle10.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 1</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle11.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 2</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle12.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 3</a>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light" style="font-size: 14px; height: 100%;">
                          <strong>Volume 3</strong>
                          <div class="mt-2">
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle7.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 1</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle8.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 2</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle9.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 3</a>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light" style="font-size: 14px; height: 100%;">
                          <strong>Volume 2</strong>
                          <div class="mt-2">
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle4.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 1</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle5.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 2</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle6.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 3</a>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light" style="font-size: 14px; height: 100%;">
                          <strong>Volume 1</strong>
                          <div class="mt-2">
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle1.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 1</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle2.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;" class="me-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 2</a>
                            <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle3.pdf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--rt-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i> Issue 3</a>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="col-lg-4 d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
                  <div class="text-center mb-4">
                    <span class="badge bg-primary mb-2" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: var(--rt-primary) !important;">LATEST ISSUE</span>
                    <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle16.pdf" target="_blank" class="d-block transition-hover">
                      <img src="/files/newsletter/chronicle16.png" alt="Campus Chronicle Issue 16" style="max-width: 220px; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(7,101,147,0.2); transition: transform 0.3s ease;" class="chronicle-cover" />
                    </a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="badge bg-secondary mb-2" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px;">PREVIOUS ISSUE</span>
                    <a href="/files/newsletter/chronicle15.pdf" target="_blank" class="d-block transition-hover">
                      <img src="/files/newsletter/chronicle15.png" alt="Campus Chronicle Issue 15" style="max-width: 200px; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); transition: transform 0.3s ease;" class="chronicle-cover" />
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <style>
            .chronicle-cover:hover {
              transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.03);
            }
          </style>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SrkrFooter />
    <OffCanvas />
    <FooterScripts />
  </body>
</html>
